2d906973-33da-4148-b40d-b8fea264d825","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"外部に与える引数は基本的には専用型を作ってそのオブジェクト一個だけを受け取る。が柔軟ですよねー。","ts":"1629350908.071700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmdWu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a0df9cc-1e0f-4cca-a59b-ec5106c070d7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"filter を書くのはプラグイン側で、本体側はそれを呼ぶ側だからそういうのは無理そうな予感","ts":"1629348104.071000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5UsXS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f127323-f183-4af3-98cc-c64c2b738b8a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なので以下みたいにかけば古い書き方でも新しい書き方でもイケるのでは（例外処理とかは省いてます、面倒なところは `...` としてます）\n\n```function a(name: string, value: string, foo: string);\nfunction a(options: {name: string, value: string, foo: string});\nfunction a(nameOrOptions: string | {name: ...}, value?: string, foo?: string) {\n   if (typeof nameOrOptions === 'string') {\n      return a({name: nameOrOptions, value, foo });\n   }\n   // 本当の処理\n}```","ts":"1629347454.069900","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1629347471.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"agi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76769743-7893-481e-a0aa-bf84e12006d4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まず大前提ですが JS にキーワード引数はないですね","ts":"1629347323.067500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AmBq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca04e007-9f9a-45c4-8217-12d227fa4d51","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あるなら是非教えて欲しい","ts":"1629347158.067100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bXR3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6add3242-7f45-446d-8981-e72aa4a9fbec","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"何か良い方法ありますか","ts":"1629347131.066700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":fal